                            "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ee380",
                            "tag": "div",
                            "text": "$$X = \\bigcup_{k=0}^n X^{(k)}, \\quad \\rho_{\\sigma \\trianglelefteq \\tau} \\colon \\mathcal{F}(\\sigma) \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{F}(\\tau)$$",
                            "style": {
                              "background": "#060606",
                              "color": "var(--pf-text-white)",
                              "font_size": 16,
                              "padding": "18px 22px",
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_p_0x12c7477ee3f0",
                            "tag": "text",
                            "text": "Каждой симплициальной клетке $\\sigma \\in X$ сопоставлен векторный стебель состояний $\\mathcal{F}(\\sigma) \\cong \\mathbb{R}^{d_\\sigma}$. Между инцидентными клетками действуют линейные операторы рестрикции $\\rho$.",
                            "style": {
                              "color": "var(--pf-text-muted)",
                              "font_size": 14,
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ee460",
                        "tag": "div",
                        "style": {
                          "background": "var(--pf-bg-card)",
                          "border_color": "1px solid var(--pf-border)",
                          "font_size": 15,
                          "padding": "24px 18px",
                          "flex_direction": "column",
                          "align_items": "flex-start",
                          "justify_content": "flex-start"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ee4d0",
                            "tag": "div",
                            "style": {
                              "font_size": 15,
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "elem_span_0x12c7477ee540",
                                "tag": "text",
                                "text": "02 \u0026bull; Нильпотентность кограницы",
                                "style": {
                                  "color": "var(--pf-red)",
                                  "font_size": 12,
                                  "font_weight": "700",
                                  "flex_direction": "column",
                                  "align_items": "flex-start",
                                  "justify_content": "flex-start"
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ee5b0",
                            "tag": "div",
                            "text": "$$(d_k x)(\\tau) = \\sum_{\\sigma \\trianglelefteq \\tau} [\\tau : \\sigma] \\rho_{\\sigma \\trianglelefteq \\tau}(x(\\sigma)) \\implies d_{k+1} \\circ d_k = 0$$",
                            "style": {
                              "background": "#060606",
                              "color": "var(--pf-text-white)",
                              "font_size": 16,
                              "padding": "18px 22px",
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_p_0x12c7477ee620",
                            "tag": "text",
                            "text": "Нильпотентность кограничного оператора Чеха–Де Рама устраняет циклы рассогласования и формирует подпространства когомологий $H^k(X, \\mathcal{F}) = \\ker(d_k) / \\mathrm{im}(d_{k-1})$.",
                            "style": {
                              "color": "var(--pf-text-muted)",
                              "font_size": 14,
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ee690",
                        "tag": "div",
                        "style": {
                          "background": "var(--pf-bg-card)",
                          "border_color": "1px solid var(--pf-border)",
                          "font_size": 15,
                          "padding": "24px 18px",
                          "flex_direction": "column",
                          "align_items": "flex-start",
                          "justify_content": "flex-start"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ee700",
                            "tag": "div",
                            "style": {
                              "font_size": 15,
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "elem_span_0x12c7477ee770",
                                "tag": "text",
                                "text": "03 \u0026bull; Спектральное разложение Ходжа",
                                "style": {
                                  "color": "var(--pf-red)",
                                  "font_size": 12,
                                  "font_weight": "700",
                                  "flex_direction": "column",
                                  "align_items": "flex-start",
                                  "justify_content": "flex-start"
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ee7e0",
                            "tag": "div",
                            "text": "$$\\Delta_k = d_{k-1} d_{k-1}^* + d_k^* d_k \\implies C^k = \\ker(\\Delta_k) \\oplus \\mathrm{im}(d_{k-1}) \\oplus \\mathrm{im}(d_k^*)$$",
                            "style": {
                              "background": "#060606",
                              "color": "var(--pf-text-white)",
                              "font_size": 16,
                              "padding": "18px 22px",
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_p_0x12c7477ee850",
                            "tag": "text",
                            "text": "Лапласиан Ходжа декомпозирует состояние распределенной базы на потенциальный поток, роторные вихри рассогласования ($H^1$) и гармонический вакуум $\\ker(\\Delta_k) \\cong H^k$.",
                            "style": {
                              "color": "var(--pf-text-muted)",
                              "font_size": 14,
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ee8c0",
                        "tag": "div",
                        "style": {
                          "background": "var(--pf-bg-card)",
                          "border_color": "1px solid var(--pf-border)",
                          "font_size": 15,
                          "padding": "24px 18px",
                          "flex_direction": "column",
                          "align_items": "flex-start",
                          "justify_content": "flex-start"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ee930",
                            "tag": "div",
                            "style": {
                              "font_size": 15,
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "elem_span_0x12c7477ee9a0",
                                "tag": "text",
                                "text": "04 \u0026bull; Бесконфликтный градиентный поток",
                                "style": {
                                  "color": "var(--pf-red)",
                                  "font_size": 12,
                                  "font_weight": "700",
                                  "flex_direction": "column",
                                  "align_items": "flex-start",
                                  "justify_content": "flex-start"
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477eea10",
                            "tag": "div",
                            "text": "$$\\frac{dx}{dt} = -\\Delta_0 x \\implies x(t) = \\exp(-t \\Delta_0) x(0), \\quad E(x) = \\langle x, \\Delta_0 x \\rangle \\to 0$$",
                            "style": {
                              "background": "#060606",
                              "color": "var(--pf-text-white)",
                              "font_size": 16,
                              "padding": "18px 22px",
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_p_0x12c7477eea80",
                            "tag": "text",
                            "text": "Вместо тяжелых блокирующих раундов сетевого голосования (Raft/Paxos) кластер исполняет непрерывную диффузию Лапласа. Энергия расхождений Дирихле $E(x)$ гарантированно стремится к нулю.",
                            "style": {
                              "color": "var(--pf-text-muted)",
                              "font_size": 14,
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "architecture",
            "tag": "div",
            "style": {
              "font_size": 15,
              "padding": "70px 0",
              "flex_direction": "column",
              "align_items": "flex-start",
              "justify_content": "flex-start"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477eeb60",
