                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "elem_circle_0x12c7477eecb0",
                            "tag": "div",
                            "style": {
                              "font_size": 15,
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "elem_span_0x12c7477eed20",
                        "tag": "text",
                        "text": "Архитектура ядра",
                        "style": {
                          "font_size": 15,
                          "flex_direction": "column",
                          "align_items": "flex-start",
                          "justify_content": "flex-start"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "elem_h2_0x12c7477eed90",
                    "tag": "text",
                    "text": "МНОГОПОТОЧНЫЙ ДВИЖОК НУЛЕВЫХ ЗАДЕРЖЕК",
                    "style": {
                      "font_size": 30,
                      "font_weight": "800",
                      "flex_direction": "column",
                      "align_items": "flex-start",
                      "justify_content": "flex-start"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "elem_span_0x12c7477eee00",
                        "tag": "text",
                        "text": ".",
                        "style": {
                          "color": "var(--pf-red)",
                          "font_size": 15,
                          "flex_direction": "column",
                          "align_items": "flex-start",
                          "justify_content": "flex-start"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "elem_p_0x12c7477eee70",
                    "tag": "text",
                    "text": "Асинхронное конвейерное разделение ответственности между пучковым ядром, журналом WAL и тепловым консенсусом.",
                    "style": {
                      "color": "var(--pf-text-muted)",
                      "font_size": 15,
                      "flex_direction": "column",
                      "align_items": "flex-start",
                      "justify_content": "flex-start"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477eeee0",
                    "tag": "div",
                    "style": {
                      "font_size": 15,
                      "flex_direction": "column",
                      "align_items": "flex-start",
                      "justify_content": "flex-start",
                      "gap": "24px"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477eef50",
                        "tag": "div",
                        "style": {
                          "background": "var(--pf-bg-card)",
                          "border_color": "1px solid var(--pf-border)",
                          "font_size": 15,
                          "padding": "24px 18px",
                          "flex_direction": "column",
                          "align_items": "flex-start",
                          "justify_content": "flex-start"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477eefc0",
                            "tag": "div",
                            "text": "01",
                            "style": {
                              "color": "var(--pf-red)",
                              "font_size": 26,
                              "font_weight": "800",
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_h3_0x12c7477ef030",
                            "tag": "text",
                            "text": "RWMutex Read/Write Split",
                            "style": {
                              "font_size": 20,
                              "font_weight": "700",
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_p_0x12c7477ef0a0",
                            "tag": "text",
                            "text": "Масштабируемые разделяемые блокировки чтения в `sheaf.go`. Выдача срезов векторов защищена методом `CloneVector`, исключая гонки данных при параллельной диффузии и достигая на тестовом стенде.",
                            "style": {
                              "color": "var(--pf-text-muted)",
                              "font_size": 14,
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "elem_strong_0x12c7477ef110",
                                "tag": "text",
                                "text": "7.48M QPS",
                                "style": {
                                  "font_size": 15,
                                  "flex_direction": "column",
                                  "align_items": "flex-start",
                                  "justify_content": "flex-start"
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ef180",
                        "tag": "div",
                        "style": {
                          "background": "var(--pf-bg-card)",
                          "border_color": "1px solid var(--pf-border)",
                          "font_size": 15,
                          "padding": "24px 18px",
                          "flex_direction": "column",
                          "align_items": "flex-start",
                          "justify_content": "flex-start"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ef1f0",
                            "tag": "div",
                            "text": "02",
                            "style": {
                              "color": "var(--pf-red)",
                              "font_size": 26,
                              "font_weight": "800",
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_h3_0x12c7477ef260",
                            "tag": "text",
                            "text": "Smart Drain Group Commit",
                            "style": {
                              "font_size": 20,
                              "font_weight": "700",
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_p_0x12c7477ef2d0",
                            "tag": "text",
                            "text": "Полный отказ от таймеров сна (`time.Sleep`). Оппортунистическое дренирование очереди с параллельным расчетом HMAC-SHA256 подписей обеспечивает запись со скоростью (10.4 мкс).",
                            "style": {
                              "color": "var(--pf-text-muted)",
                              "font_size": 14,
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "elem_strong_0x12c7477ef340",
                                "tag": "text",
                                "text": "95.9K TPS",
                                "style": {
                                  "font_size": 15,
                                  "flex_direction": "column",
                                  "align_items": "flex-start",
                                  "justify_content": "flex-start"
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ef3b0",
                        "tag": "div",
                        "style": {
                          "background": "var(--pf-bg-card)",
                          "border_color": "1px solid var(--pf-border)",
                          "font_size": 15,
                          "padding": "24px 18px",
                          "flex_direction": "column",
                          "align_items": "flex-start",
                          "justify_content": "flex-start"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "elem_div_0x12c7477ef420",
                            "tag": "div",
                            "text": "03",
                            "style": {
                              "color": "var(--pf-red)",
                              "font_size": 26,
                              "font_weight": "800",
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_h3_0x12c7477ef490",
                            "tag": "text",
                            "text": "Кэш Операторов Ходжа",
                            "style": {
                              "font_size": 20,
                              "font_weight": "700",
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "elem_p_0x12c7477ef500",
                            "tag": "text",
                            "text": "Матрица $\\Delta_0$ предкомпилируется один раз при топологических изменениях комплекса. Параллельные горутины исполняют шаги теплового градиента за без накладных расходов.",
                            "style": {
                              "color": "var(--pf-text-muted)",
                              "font_size": 14,
                              "flex_direction": "column",
                              "align_items": "flex-start",
                              "justify_content": "flex-start"
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "id": "elem_strong_0x12c7477ef570",
                                "tag": "text",
                                "text": "0.39 мкс",
                                "style": {
                                  "font_size": 15,
                                  "flex_direction": "column",
                                  "align_items": "flex-start",
                                  "justify_content": "flex-start"
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
