                                "id": "elem_code_0x12c747843c00",
                                "tag": "div",
                                "text": "topospatia::DB; serde_json::json; () -\u003e Result\u0026lt;(), Box\u0026lt; std::error::Error\u0026gt;\u0026gt; { db = DB:: ( , 2, 2, )?; v0 = db. (\u0026[0])?; v1 = db. (\u0026[1])?; edge = db. (\u0026[0, 1])?;\n    db. ()?; db. ( , \u0026edge, 1, \u0026[2.4, 8.1], \u0026json!({ : }))?; report = db. ()?;\n    println!( , report.final_energy); rag_result = db. (\u0026[0], 3, 0.15)?;\n    println!( , rag_result);\n    Ok(())\n}",
                                "style": {
