                                "tag": "div",
                                "text": "topospatia DB json db = DB( , max_dim=2, stalk_dim=2, fsync=False) : c0 = db.add_cell([0])\n    c1 = db.add_cell([1])\n    c_edge = db.add_cell([0, 1])\n    db.compile() db.put(\n        doc_id= ,\n        cell_id=c0,\n        dim=0,\n        vector=[0.85, 0.42],\n        payload={ : , : 0.99}\n    ) betti = db.betti(tolerance=1e-5)\n    print(f ) scores = db.rag_diffuse(seeds=[0], steps=3, alpha=0.1)\n    print(f ) :\n    db.close()",
